  "content": {
    "id": "p40-q19-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "19",
    "prompt": "2 ships leave from the same port. One ship travels on a bearing of $157^{\\circ}$ at 20 knots. The second ship travels on a bearing of $247^{\\circ}$ at 35 knots.\n\n(A knot is a speed of 1 nautical mile per hour.)",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p40-q19-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "How far apart are the ships after 8 hours? Answer in nautical miles to 2 d.p.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "322.49 nautical miles",
          "worked": "Let $P$ be the port, $A$ the first ship and $B$ the second ship. Draw the two routes with north arrows at $P$ and $A$.\n\nThe routes form a right angle at $P$ because $247^{\\circ}-157^{\\circ}=90^{\\circ}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}PA&=20\\times8=160\\text{ nautical miles}\\\\PB&=35\\times8=280\\text{ nautical miles}\\\\AB^2&=160^2+280^2\\\\AB&=\\sqrt{104000}\\\\AB&\\approx322.49\\text{ nautical miles}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "p40-q19-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Calculate the bearing of the second ship from the first, to the nearest minute.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$276^{\\circ}45'$",
          "worked": "The bearing of the port $P$ from the first ship $A$ is $157^{\\circ}+180^{\\circ}=337^{\\circ}$. Let $\\theta=\\angle PAB$ in the right-angled triangle.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\tan\\theta&=\\frac{280}{160}\\\\\\theta&=\\tan^{-1}\\!\\left(\\frac{280}{160}\\right)\\\\\\text{Bearing of }B\\text{ from }A&=337^{\\circ}-\\tan^{-1}\\!\\left(\\frac{280}{160}\\right)\\\\\\text{Bearing of }B\\text{ from }A&\\approx276^{\\circ}45'\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 40
      }
    ]
  },
